  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening Program for the National Senate</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento del Senado de la Nacin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es contribuir al fortalecimiento de los mecanismos de gobernabilidad democrtica en la Argentina, a travs del mejoramiento de las funciones bsicas del Senado de La Nacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the institutional strengthening of the Argentine Senate so as to improve its parliamentary and administrative management capacity in the context of greater transparency. The program has four components: (i) support for parliamentary management and the lawmaking process; (ii) administrative and financial management of the Senate; (iii) human resources management, optimization, and training; and (iv) change management and public information.</narrative>
  </description>
